                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "other",
                        "id": "8tHKB2"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 10",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "Supercompost is far better than normal compost, but more expensive to make. You need to rot the right type of item; show me an item, and I'll tell you if it's super- compostable or not."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "other",
                        "id": "F1-4Yo"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 11",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "Vegetables, hops and flowers need constant watering - if you ignore my advice, you will sooner or later find yourself in possession of a dead farming patch."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "other",
                        "id": "sxN14w"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 12",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "The only way to cure a bush or tree of disease is to prune away the diseased leaves with a pair of secateurs. For all other crops I would just apply some plant-cure."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "other",
                        "id": "2T--uk"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 13",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "There are five other Farming areas like this one - Elstan's area near Falador, Dantaera's area near Catherby, Kragen's area near Ardougne, Lyra's area in Morytania, Marisi's area in Hosidius and Oswallt's area"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "in Prifddinas."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "other",
                        "id": "AvZMut"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 14",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "If you want to grow fruit trees you could try a few places: Catherby, Brimhaven, Gnome Stronghold and the Farming Guild all have fruit tree patches."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "other",
                        "id": "gWDvAn"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 15",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "Hops are good for brewing ales. I believe there's a brewery up in Keldagrim somewhere, and I've heard rumours that a place called Phasmatys used to be good for that type of thing. 'Fore they all died, of course."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "other",
                        "id": "zvs4gC"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 16",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "Bittercap mushrooms can only be grown in a special patch in Morytania, near the Mort Myre swamp. There the ground is especially dank and suited to growing poisonous fungii."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "other",
                        "id": "yiDox3"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 17",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "There is a special patch for growing Belladonna - I believe that it is somewhere near Draynor Manor, where the ground is a tad 'unblessed'."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "other",
                        "id": "BtuY1m"
                      }
                    ]
